    <statement><p>Let <m>f(x,y) = 4x^{2}+5xy+4y^{2}</m>.</p>
<p>Then an implicit equation for the tangent plane
to the graph of <m>f</m> at the point <m>(0,-2)</m> is
<fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0001"/>.</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>10x+16y+z = -16</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
